        <body>
            <div xml:id="d553-a8">

                <pb facs="0927" n="857" xml:id="pg857"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 7.—Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Daniel to Mr. Stevens.</hi></head>
                <p>Mr. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Consul</hi>: Though your telegram arrived, there
                    is not yet any result. The sickness of the doctor is grave; for the recovery of
                    his health there is no hope. He is-always under the surveillance of two
                    zaptiehs, as if he were an assassin. He implores, your interference and
                    efficacious protection.</p>
                <closer><signed>DANIEL.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
